Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Jostra-san, you don't know\Nwhere Jotaro is right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't feel his presence at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff and Iggy, I hope they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, do you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we're the only ones left\Nstanding, we've got to defeat Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, how are your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm doing much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.47,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble I put you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.39,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm ready now to fight Dio to\Nthe fullest extent of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Be vigilant, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Avdol was taken out\Nin the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we encountered\NDio's stand, the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:06:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,we weren't able to actually\Nsee its abilities at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Some way to fight Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio is after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he'll be coming after my\NJoestar blood, that's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He plans to finish us before sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.53,0:06:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Before then, we're sure to get a chance\Nto uncover the secret of his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And once we do, then we strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,These automobiles, what power and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.05,0:07:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I was born, there were\Nonly horse carriages around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this car still working?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.99,0:07:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And just who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you if this\Ncar is still working?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on! If you're not\Nhurt, then just get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And another thing keep your damn\Nhands off the car buddy or maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you bumped into it On purpose\Nknowing that it's the senator's car?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you young people seem to\Nact on your impulses too easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in any case, I apologize\Nfor my driver's behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hope you didn't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You knocked out my driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're in a hurry,\Nand I don't mean to offend you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,please take this and you can hail a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What in God's name do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea\Nwho you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the small red pickup truck ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive until you catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't imagine you're actually\Ngoing to get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a center of the United\NStates of America, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't catch up, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll execute you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you executed for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and start the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better hurry up,\Nwhile you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch, must have broke a few of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm lucky to be alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I have no idea how I managed\Nto survive Dio's point-blank attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what is his stand, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard the tarot card\Nrepresenting it is the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even see his\Nstand, let alone study it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I did figure out one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.91,0:10:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.47,0:10:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but the speed and power\Nof your stand and my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum look to be\Npretty evenly matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of incredible secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's way more intimidating than any\Nof the other stand users I've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder N'Doul and Iced\Npledge their undying loyalty to Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're bad-assed enough\Nto be my opponent, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just take a look around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll understand\Nthat the traffic is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not moving at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some space on the sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The sidewalk is packed with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to go faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.37,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio, please stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio, the dark atmosphere he\Nexudes is closing in on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I can feel his existence through the\Nsensations in the Joestar blood we share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's nearby, but I\Ncan't pinpoint his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.43,0:12:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the same goes for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.31,0:12:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If we have to fight him here, we'll\Ninvolve a lot of innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A red pickup. A red pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet that's the one\Nyou were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure he doesn't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull up a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The game is almost over, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kakyoin's Hierophant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He evaded Emerald Splash\Nat such close range?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, didn't even graze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll concentrate it more this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't fight without a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just try to lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But Chostar-san, we haven't figured\Nout anything about his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We bought ourselves some\Ntime to work on a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, how are your wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost control of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.63,0:15:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was able to figure out\Na couple things. About Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is similar to\NJotaro's Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem to possess\Nany projectile weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and its reach appears to\Nbe relatively limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that could work to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We get beaten before we even\Nrealize what's going on. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For us not to sense his\Npresence when he appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly appearing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of secret power could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.65,0:16:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible for his stand to possess\Nsome sort of teleportation abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, that would explain\Nwhy he's able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, that's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A hasty conclusion could\Ncost you your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be too careful when dealing\Nwith someone as powerful as Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he involve\Ninnocent people in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Kakyoin? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.25,0:17:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A way to reveal the true\Nnature of Dio's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, there's no use trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I don't see Kakyoin around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:18:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they going to attack from two sides?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's Kakyoin's Hierophant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A barrier created by Hierophant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How clever of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.99,0:19:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like my barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hierophant's barrier\Nfires back when touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrounds you in a radius of 20 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can detect every single\Nmove that you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.53,0:19:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got you now, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:19:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Show it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, your first name\Nis Noriyaki, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.19,0:20:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you now? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would someone so young\Nwish to hurry his death?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you don't understand the severity\Nof the situation you're in now, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what kind of\Npower the world possesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you cannot move one inch from that spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you frightened of\Nme, Noriyaki Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you were last year. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true that I gave in to\Nnauseating fear when I first met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.03,0:20:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But no longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you are a thoughtful\Nand excellent stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Such unusual qualities?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What worth do you see in protecting and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,sacrificing your life for\Nan old man like Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.03,0:21:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,While Jotaro and Joseph-san did save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only part of the\Nreason I fight with them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been fighting to regain my honor after\Nall the indignities I suffered from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.47,0:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not too late yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pledge eternal loyalty and you will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is my answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.85,0:21:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness now my stand, which has the\Npower to rule this world completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.21,0:21:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand is the world, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.03,0:22:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,in the stillness of time, you are not\Nable to see nor feel anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.27,0:22:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know that\Nyour death is now assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way for you\Nto know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're next, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.99,0:22:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Dio do this? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it seven o 'clock now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.49,0:23:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be midnight in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Father. Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.49,0:23:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems my time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.59,0:23:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been a short life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.03,0:23:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to Jotaro and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.73,0:23:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can die knowing that I\Ndidn't give in to my fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I was no match for Dio's\Npower, I lived my life as I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.71,0:23:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.61,0:23:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar-san, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to defeat Dio, nor\Nfind the secrets to Dio's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:24:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But why? Why was a perfect barrier broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,all at once i saw
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.03,0:24:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,every move despite that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.71,0:24:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,not just one part but\Nthe entire barrier of
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.95,0:24:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,20 meters at once why without any time lag
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.25,0:24:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Without any time lag.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.03,0:24:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.01,0:24:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that must be it it's the\Nonly thing I can think
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,of time he can stop time\NI must let him know this
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.47,0:24:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shocking truth, somehow I\Nmust let Jostar-san know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.19,0:24:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise Jostar-san's And\NHolly-san's lives will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.45,0:24:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.21,0:24:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The best way to melt my\Nhead onto Jonathan Joestar's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.43,0:24:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,body is to use the blood\Nof his closest relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.89,0:25:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar, I'm letting you know that\NI will kill you by sucking your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.51,0:25:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Before it adapts, I'll cut you in\Nhalf right through that scar of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.21,0:25:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That bloodline of yours that speaks\Ntoo boldly is now coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.89,0:25:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Last...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.09,0:25:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shooting in such a random direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.35,0:25:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It could well be the\Nexertion of his last moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.71,0:25:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.31,0:25:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin is not the kind of man to do\Nsomething pointless at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.27,0:25:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But why that clock tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.75,0:25:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar-san, please, accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.89,0:26:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.25,0:26:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.45,0:26:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You old man, your stand is\Nthe most pathetic of them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.13,0:26:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some\Nimportant meaning to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.15,0:26:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, what was it you tried\Nto tell me with the clock tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.79,0:26:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying the clock tower like\Nthat, what's the meaning of it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.75,0:26:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use trying to escape, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.07,0:26:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Dio's The World Secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.89,0:27:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But to destroy the clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.51,0:27:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,To stop the clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.23,0:27:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.14,0:27:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopping the clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.65,0:27:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.67,0:27:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saying the world can stop time?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand now, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.09,0:27:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The message you sent me with your last\Nounce of strength, I have received it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.03,0:27:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.07,0:27:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, you are quite a\Nschemer, aren't you, Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.41,0:27:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The same could be said about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.09,0:27:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you noticed my wave\Nenergy shield, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.55,0:27:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know something about you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.83,0:28:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For you to come after\Nus like this must mean
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that your ability to stop\Ntime is very limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.15,0:28:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you managed to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.91,0:28:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to compliment you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.13,0:28:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The one to figure it out was Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.41,0:28:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He did not die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.13,0:28:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So you figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you're going\Nto be able to do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.67,0:28:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wave energy means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.19,0:29:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.79,0:29:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.95,0:29:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.86,0:29:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected, he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.37,0:29:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But he is out of the range of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with Joseph first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.97,0:29:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, the true nature\Nof the world is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.05,0:29:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio's stand can stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.05,0:29:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beginning, my power was only\Nable to stop time for a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.51,0:29:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But as the scar on my neck is fading,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.73,0:29:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the time frame has increased\Nup to five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.93,0:29:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I will be able to stop\Ntime for as long as I may desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.19,0:30:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarding yourself with wave energy\Nwon't do you any good, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.87,0:30:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred years ago, the wave\Nenergy was a slight problem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But now with the power of the\Nworld, it's insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.75,0:30:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonathan's grandson Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.75,0:30:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.55,0:30:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Three seconds. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.03,0:30:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One. Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.59,0:30:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.49,0:30:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.59,0:30:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.59,0:30:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.91,0:30:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.07,0:31:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already finished\Noff your friend, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.75,0:31:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you're the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.11,0:31:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.05,0:31:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you coming for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.47,0:31:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not obeying your late grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.57,0:31:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming very close to Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.01,0:31:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, gotta get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to mess you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.85,0:32:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vincere
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.11,0:32:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vincere. Vincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Vincere
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.95,0:32:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I love you in the shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.75,0:33:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.69,0:33:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.89,0:34:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.69,0:34:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.63,0:35:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
